- Assumed `ApiResponse`/`PageMeta` live in a shared `com.acme.common.api` package and `InvoiceService`/`InvoiceQueryResult` are already in `com.acme.billing` as given — no error handling or DTO conversion added in the controller since that's the service/`@RestControllerAdvice` layer's job per convention.

